-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SearXNG (not included)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
https://github.com/searxng/searxng, AGPL-3.0.
searxng/install.sh downloads SearXNG at a pinned commit and runs it,
unmodified, as a separate local program. Retrofind talks to it only over its
HTTP JSON API. No SearXNG code is copied into this repository.

