-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ideas, no code
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
These projects inspired parts of the design. Nothing was copied from them.

- onepointfive-REAL/google-search-lite (no licence): a lightweight,
  Google-style search page.
- gaoryrt/retro-404 (no licence): a Win98 message box for error pages.
- azayrahmad/win98-web (MIT): a Win98 desktop with a taskbar in the browser.
- xenitV1/liquid-glass-skill (MIT): keep glass on chrome over a detailed
  backdrop, and keep reading text on solid surfaces.
